{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09192","headline":"酬元伟过洛阳夜燕 · 韦应物","name":"酬元伟过洛阳夜燕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三载寄关东，所懽皆远违。\n思怀方耿耿，忽得观容辉。\n亲燕在良夜，欢携辟中闱。\n问我犹杜门，不能奋高飞。\n明灯照四隅，炎炭正可依。\n清觞虽云酌，所媿乏珍肥。\n晨装复当行，寥落星已稀。\n何以慰心曲，伫子西还归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}